doc hero.md
src 255
# Install

jupynvim draws notebooks
inside Neovim.

> [!NOTE]
> Needs Ghostty 1.3 or kitty.

- [x] Rust backend
- [ ] Widgets

| Terminal | Images |
|----------|:------:|
| Ghostty  | yes    |
| WezTerm  | soon   |

```lua
require("jupynvim").setup()
```

text 255
